{"sourceUrl":"https://law.btbu.edu.cn/sylm/tzgg/e27dc1ed42c849a299c8f80d50b05dd5.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:52.411330+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://law.btbu.edu.cn/sylm/tzgg/e27dc1ed42c849a299c8f80d50b05dd5.htm","html":"<div>\n<p></p>\n<p><span><span>根</span></span><span><span>据《</span></span><span><span>北京工商大学接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生工作管理办法</span></span><span><span>》和《北京工商大学关于开展</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年接收</span></span><span><span>推免生</span></span><span><span>工作的通知</span></span><span><span>》的工作要求</span></span><span><span>，法学院按如下方案开展接收</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7年</span></span><span><span>推免生</span></span><span><span>工作</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.获得推荐免试资格的全日制普通高校的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></p>\n<p><span>2.符合</span><span><span>我院各专业接收推免生的条件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p>\n<p><span>4.身体健康状况符合国家和学校规定的体检要求</span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5.</span><span><span>申请专业与本科所学专业应当相同或相近，原则上不得跨一级学科报考。申请法律（非法学）专业学位的推免生，本科所学专业须为非法学专业（普通高等学校本科专业目录法学门类中的法学类专业</span></span><span>[代码为0301]毕业生不得申请）；申请法律（法学）专业学位的推免生，本科所学专业须为法学专业（仅普通高等学校本科专业目录法学门类中的法学类专业[代码为0301]毕业生可以申请）。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、申请材料</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.四级或六级成绩单、在校学习成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.发表的学术论文、著作、教材、专利或其他可体现学术能力的成果和获奖证书（须提交原件的扫描件）；</span></span> </p>\n<p><span><span>3.个人自述（1000 字以内，主要说明个人情况及申请攻读研究生报告，要求手写签名）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.研究生招生考试诚信承诺书</span></span><span><span>（见附件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.北京工商大学硕士研究生政审函调表（见附件）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>正式报名时，上述材料通过教育部推免系统上传扫描件。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、报名程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.预报名</span></p>\n<p><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>登录北京工商大学预报名系统进行预报名。</span></span> </p>\n<p><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>登录网址</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><a href=\"https://zhaosheng.eol.cn/10011/user/login/login\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://zhaosheng.eol.cn/10011/user/login/login\">https://zhaosheng.eol.cn/10011/user/login/login</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>预</span></span><span><span>报名时间截止至</span></span><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span>9月2</span></strong><strong><span><span>0</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>9</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span>00</span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> <span>2.正式报名</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>登录教育部</span><span>“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（简称“推免服务系统”）</span></span><span><span>进行报名。正式报名是接收推免生的必要环节，考生必须在教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”规定时间内完成正式报名。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>推免生综合考核</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>推免生综合考核分为材料审核和面试，综合考核成绩</span></span><span><span>=材料审核成绩（30%）+面试成绩（70%），综合考核成绩相同者按面试成绩排序。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span><span>材料审核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>审核材料包括：（</span><span>1）外语水平证明和在校学习成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）；（2）发表的学术论文、著作、教材、专利或其他可体现学术能力的成果和获奖证书（须提交原件的扫描件）；（3）个人自述（1000 字以内，主要说明个人情况及申请攻读研究生报告，要求手写签名）；（4）研究生招生考试诚信承诺书。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院成立材料审核专家组，</span></span><span><span>对推免生的申请材料进行客观独立打分</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>推免生材料审核成绩取专家打分的平均值。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span><span>面试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）面试</span></span><span><span>原则</span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>坚持公开、公平、公正原则，在对考生进行全面考查的基础上，实行择优选拔。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）面试</span></span><span><span>时间</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院将在预推免阶段和正式推免阶段组织</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>，具体时间根据报名人数和安排另行通知，请及时关注邮箱信息并保持手机畅通。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）面试</span></span><span><span>形式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>采取</span></span><span><span>双机位线上面试，线上面试流程及要求</span></span><span><span>见附件。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）面试</span></span><span><span>内容及</span></span><span><span>成绩</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试主要</span></span><span><span>考查</span></span><span><span>学生的综合素质和专业理论知识，包括英语口语听力水平、语言表达、逻辑思维、学习目标等。</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>成绩</span><span>(100分)=综合素质面试（70分）+英语（30分），</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>成绩低于</span><span>60分为不及格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.体检</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>所有拟录取推免生须在拟录取后进行体检，可待</span><span>2027年统考硕士研究生体检要求出台后再执行。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>思想政治素质和道德品质考核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>思想政治素质和道德品质考核主要通过人事档案审查（政审）、《国家教育考试考生诚信档案》对考生诚信状况进行核查。考生填写硕士研究生政审函调表（</span></span><span><span>见</span></span><span><span>附件）由本人所在学校政工部门加盖印章，方为有效。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>录取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>学院根据</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>择优</span></span><span><span>确定拟接收推免生名单，</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>成绩</span></span><span>60分（含）以上者方可录取，面试成绩低于60分者不能录取。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>学院通过教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”向申请者发出《拟录取通知》。申请者在“推免服务系统”回复确认后，即取得北京工商大学推免生录取资格，逾期未确认者视为放弃。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>若申请人提交的信息不准确或不真实，一经发现，立即取消其推免生资格，并通报申请人所在学校。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>所有推免生只能录取为全日制非定向就业</span></span><span><span>硕士</span></span><span><span>研究生。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六、学制</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学术型硕士</span></span><span>3年</span></p>\n<p><span><span>专业学位硕士</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>法律</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>非法学</span></span><span><span>）</span><span>3年，法律（法学）2年。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七</span></span></strong><span><span>、</span></span><strong><span><span>招生咨询</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：王老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：（</span></span><span>010）81353346</span><span><span>（良乡校区）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子邮件信箱：</span></span><span><span>wangdanjun@btbu.edu.cn</span></span>  </p>\n<p><strong><span><span>八、</span> <span>202</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年法学院接收推免生计划</span></span></strong></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>专业代码</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>专业名称</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>推免生拟接收人数</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（可根据实际报名情况调整）</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>030105</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>民商法学</span></span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>      8</span></span><span><span>人</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>030106</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>诉讼法学</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>030107</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>经济法学</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>030109</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>国际法学</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>035101</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>法律（非法学）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>人</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>035102</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>法律（法学）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>人</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p>附件一<a href=\"https://law.btbu.edu.cn/docs/2026-09/9ebd7466eb3b4642b02dfbbb8524a9da.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：北京工商大学2027年研究生招生考试诚信承诺书</a></p>\n<p>附件二<a href=\"https://law.btbu.edu.cn/docs/2026-09/3f7fbad3c880490ab3af342488d4fb7f.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：北京工商大学硕士研究生政审函调表</a></p>\n<p>附件三<a href=\"https://law.btbu.edu.cn/docs/2026-09/91cbe7f9c681463189857edbd9eb8b6d.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3：北京工商大学法学院接收推免生面试程序与规范</a></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>                                          </span></p>\n<p><span></span><br/></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"c10cd2fb30420b4b88e6980ee9657ed0c7876a2c8e373d4059d24f35273f5f89","textLength":1972,"sourceSha256":"979a7066e2549be1e8fc47b1c743bbf99148d90838c967278700f770d267737e","selector":"article-like:article02","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-fc98c4a0239cef1ddca2","title":"2026年北京工商大学法学院关于接收2027年免试攻读硕士研究生工作的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:52.411330+00:00"}
